    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle begins deep within the forest...<br>Legendary orcs and powerful wizards have risen to claim the mystical woodland. You are the only hero who can protect these sacred lands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tower defense game filled with magic and warfare, you\u2019ll strategically place defense towers to halt waves of orcs and wizards. Each new wave grows more devastating, cunning, and ruthless. But remember: the mysterious powers of the forest are on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary tower effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable defense towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven level progression and mystical forest zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant visuals, magical music, and immersive sound effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest of Siege is not just a tower defense game; it\u2019s an epic battle for the fate of the forest.<br>Build your towers and claim victory against the endless enemies of the woodland!</p>",
